  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8dNQkxR.png\" alt=\"萬用鋸木機模組\" width=\"1217\" height=\"800\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"補充品Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"補充品Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube頻道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">萬用鋸木機專精於一件事，並且做得非常好。<br>這個模組新增了一個鋸木機工作站，讓你可以製作任何木製物品。<br>這項功能已完美融入你的世界，包含獨特的村民房屋和木匠村民，提供無縫的體驗。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下是所有功能列表</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鋸木機配方<strong>相容於任何模組</strong>，可製作任何木材衍生的方塊</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>木匠村民</strong>可以在鋸木機工作</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">資料驅動的木匠交易</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">木匠擁有<strong>5種獨特的房屋</strong>，可在你的村莊中生成，手工製作以完美符合原版村莊風格</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鋸木機工作站還具有獨特的<strong>鋸木音效</strong><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支援KubeJs整合，以便你需要添加額外配方（你也可以使用資料包）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">資料驅動的村民交易（使用Moonlight村民交易系統）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不會塞滿多餘的木製方塊，只有鋸木機而已</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">相容於Repurposed Structures模組</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你是模組包作者，且<strong>不想要動態配方生成</strong>嗎？只需啟用<em>save_recipes</em>設定，即可將所有配方生成為JSON格式，以便靜態添加到你的模組包中！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/otkWqcPNu2A?si=fUhw7QOWF125LxYl\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 製作團隊🏆</strong></span></p><blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plantkillable：所有紋理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Raspmary：鋸木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Zapsplat.org：原始鋸木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">AlleCraft：戰利品表</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Artkek：部分建築結構</span></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組開發花費我很多時間，所以如果你喜歡我的作品，並想支持我，可以在這裡這麼做。如果你支持我，你將獲得一個專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代碼\"supplementaries\"從Akliz購買伺服器，也同樣適用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看Akliz，他們提供專為模組版Minecraft設計的頂級伺服器。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們真的有一個溫馨的社群，支援服務很棒，伺服器運作得非常好。<br>使用代碼\"supplementaries\"可享<strong>8折優惠</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"鬧鬼豐收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪白精靈\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"儲物標籤\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"山羊強化\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡樹\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯階梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/997/638414771733478975.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed（效果描述）\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的荷葉\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/992/638414764957723804.png\" alt=\"進度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"隨機礦\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"安心入睡\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"多音調\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"心靈之石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"地圖集\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"萬用鋸木機\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
